Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:11.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,新松原第二防線被突破
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:14.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 可以了 諾伊曼 起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:15.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:19.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:25.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒事了 至少能坐在CIC裡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:31.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 怎麼回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:34.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傷也好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.27,0:00:37.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,待在這裡又會受傷的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:42.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky Grasper…雖然是戰鬥機
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:44.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為你準備的 用它離開吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:53.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是烏茲米 納拉 阿斯哈之女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:54.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:57.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,國防本部聽得見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.87,0:00:59.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:01.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是穆…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.30,0:01:04.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是穆吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:15.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳 你留在船塢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:20.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊後Archangel會和ZAFT作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:24.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不能讓你留在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:26.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭大人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:28.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.06,0:01:30.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎還未發現
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.45,0:01:33.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎抵抗得非常頑強
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:36.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.16,0:01:39.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.05,0:01:41.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但留在這船塢裡就沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:43.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:45.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:48.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:57.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係的 我沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:02:00.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 請別丢下我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.31,0:02:01.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:07.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.87,0:02:13.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用3人出場
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.91,0:02:14.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我就夠了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:17.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.15,0:02:19.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 真
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.01,0:02:23.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要打奧布的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.29,0:02:25.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也得由我來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:28.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主閘門打開
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.29,0:02:30.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主閘門打開
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:32.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拘束臂解除
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:34.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎20%
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:36.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,微速前進
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:09.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.43,0:03:13.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐 請小心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:14.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT的援兵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.95,0:03:15.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.97,0:03:29.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,航向20
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:32.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel 全速前進
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあるのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慰めながら、不謹慎だけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,泣いてる顔も綺麗で焦るよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,くじけず夢を見ることは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自分と戦ってること
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,日ごとに増える擦り傷を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自慢してもいいくらいさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあげよう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それはもう一人じゃないと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の孤独剥がす言葉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,どんなペシミストも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恋をして変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,選んだ道がもし行き止まりなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そこで迷えばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:30.24,Title SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)}{\blur4}自由與正義
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:33.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,遠道而來辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:34.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,庫拉提斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:36.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡 不過目標呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.49,0:05:39.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒壓制住嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:39.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.66,0:05:43.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們一開始還兵敗如山倒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.43,0:05:44.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但好像重整了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:47.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是該說他們後勁十足呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:50.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva取左翼位置
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:52.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,支援布理德隊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:53.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:57.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舵10 引擎減速
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.01,0:05:58.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,準備著水
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.18,0:06:01.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖不是最前線但也別大意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:03.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保持對空監視
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:03.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:09.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被這傢伙突破的話奧布就…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.78,0:06:13.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:21.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把光束彈開了?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:24.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.23,0:06:33.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:45.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種雜碎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:03.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是隊長機嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:07.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明明沒什麼本事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.75,0:07:12.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,初島 顯示光學影像
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:16.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵陣熱紋對照
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:19.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,博斯戈洛夫級2 貝倫貝爾克級4
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:21.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊薩魯克級8 還有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.41,0:07:22.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:24.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:26.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是在直布羅陀嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:28.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來追吉普利爾的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:31.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:34.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然沒沉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:39.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Akatsuki 在2點方向與敵MS交戰中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:44.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny 真
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:07:59.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:01.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上空有物體接近
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:05.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS…不 好快
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:06.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:20.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:30.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:38.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.07,0:08:41.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊 怎麼會?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.35,0:08:44.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.11,0:08:49.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:50.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.27,0:08:54.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉艦長 拉克絲就拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:56.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡交給我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉到國防本部去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:08:59.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.49,0:09:03.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:16.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦上前 可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:20.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,立即離水升空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:21.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舵10
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:23.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在開始攻擊Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.99,0:09:24.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:35.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva來了 準備好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:36.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:42.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一號十號發射管 裝填Parsifal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.17,0:09:44.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tristan Isolde
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:46.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄準 Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.99,0:09:48.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,後部導彈發射管
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.45,0:09:50.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全炮門裝填Wombat
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:52.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gottfried Valient
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:53.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄準 Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:05.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.11,0:10:59.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:00.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉閣下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:03.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我要降落到國防本部 掩護我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:14.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:16.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT的空降部隊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.86,0:11:26.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還真討厭啊 地球的重力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:29.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼呢 上吧夥計們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.01,0:11:32.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:42.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉艦長 卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:52.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空降艇的MS不是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:57.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先是他 上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:11:58.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:11:59.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要上了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:03.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Jet Stream Attack
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.78,0:12:18.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們是我們的同伴 請不必在意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:21.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:23.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:24.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:27.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:29.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然會是你坐在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:31.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.90,0:12:35.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 因為真的只是坐在裡面而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:38.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭你自己沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.97,0:12:39.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.48,0:12:43.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是指身體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:02.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tristan 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:04.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.38,0:13:06.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Wombat 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:12.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 為什麼這麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.71,0:13:26.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是光束的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:29.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經結束了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你想這麼說嗎!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:43.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射管一號二號 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.25,0:13:45.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄準引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.71,0:13:47.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪瑞克 迴避交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:47.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:50.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 叫回真
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:55.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,情況有變 這樣不好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.15,0:13:58.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那你或露娜瑪莉雅出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:02.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們當然也會出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.39,0:14:03.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在此之前先讓真返航
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:06.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也需要維修和補給
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:11.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不擊落它 這場戰鬥就不會有勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:14.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 交給你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:15.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過要趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:16.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:19.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雅比 前線的情況怎麼樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:22.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標還沒壓制住嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:29.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 還沒有這方面的報告
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.98,0:14:36.19,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}初島 奧布軍 國防本部
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:03.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙 為什麼打不下來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.68,0:15:04.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,給我下來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:09.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 返航
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 還沒…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:17.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是命令 想贏它就回來一次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:19.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.85,0:15:30.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:32.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:33.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:36.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,過分 這太過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.03,0:15:40.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 你不在的時候我拚命…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:47.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Justice嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.31,0:15:48.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:50.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,給我用的?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.89,0:15:55.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎麼說 作出選擇的是你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:57.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.53,0:16:00.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒說是你一個人的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:02.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和烏納特還有你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.97,0:16:07.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有和首長們交換意見卻未完成自己職責的我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:09.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也很不對
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:11.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 這…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.73,0:16:13.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.65,0:16:14.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使意見不同
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:18.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以為大家想保護國家的心意是相同的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:22.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:25.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說 吉普利爾在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.14,0:16:29.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今還要袒護他嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.77,0:16:33.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是說過了嗎 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:34.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:37.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的真的不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:41.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然的確曾經在我們這裡 現在卻…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:46.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了 帶走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:48.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:50.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輝夜的封鎖完成了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.23,0:16:51.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:55.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之要分秒必爭抓住吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.25,0:16:56.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:16:59.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠反擊的話今後自然有出路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:01.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在只要考慮這些
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.94,0:17:19.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也想說我只能是個戰士嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.93,0:17:33.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別擴大戰場
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:36.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何要在這裡擋住
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:42.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要決定這些的也正是你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:46.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可怕的是封閉自我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.19,0:17:49.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣了 到此結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:51.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣認輸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.51,0:18:06.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對現在傷痕累累的你來說或許很殘酷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.19,0:18:09.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是基拉他…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.75,0:18:11.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我用它?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:14.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 能矇混過關
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:16.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一石二鳥不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.85,0:18:18.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 對現在的阿斯蘭來說
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:22.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我也這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:27.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 想做什麼的時候卻無能為力的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.86,0:18:30.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是最痛苦的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.99,0:18:33.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.03,0:18:37.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,力量只是力量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:43.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而你 或許的確是位戰士
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.55,0:18:45.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但還是阿斯蘭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:53.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:06.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舵20 迂迴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.63,0:19:08.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Parsifal 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:10.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,11點方向導彈8
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.28,0:19:10.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:24.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky Grasper
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.59,0:19:28.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 做了多餘的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.55,0:19:30.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.69,0:19:33.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我 討厭那個Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:37.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 你們會贏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:41.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我是化不可能為可能的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:53.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是第二區 沒有發現行蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:55.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是第六區 沒有發現
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.66,0:19:58.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第三區 無異常
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:09.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny作業完成 能夠出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.35,0:20:10.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:12.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅留下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.09,0:20:17.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 那傢伙 這次一定要…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:18.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:21.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,注意力分散的話真會輸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:23.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:25.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對現在的他來說 你會礙事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:34.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沉著些 真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:38.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你受到挑釁迷失自我的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:40.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能贏的也變贏不了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:45.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny Legend  開始出擊程序
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.87,0:20:51.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那正是對手希望看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:53.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好 那是亡靈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.17,0:21:00.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要擊毀他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.79,0:21:06.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥  Destiny出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:14.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 查 巴勒路  Legend出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.09,0:21:21.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:33.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,708.4)}我們到底該與誰如何戰鬥…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.99,0:21:35.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(988.8,705.2)}但是你能做的事 你想做的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.55,0:21:39.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(260.8,706.8)}你本人應該最清楚不過了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:41.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1008,703.6)}不管怎麼說 作出選擇的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.65,0:22:02.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.13,0:22:09.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉  Justice出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,何も知らないほうが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸せというけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はきっと滿足しないはずだから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕が選んだ今を生きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の速さは僕に似ている
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,齒止めのきかなくなる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空が怖くなって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はいつまで頑張ればいいの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,二人ならば終わらせることができる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.86,0:23:26.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.12,0:23:29.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為那代表著一切的結束
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.33,0:23:33.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然而 如此聚集著的思念也一樣強烈
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:35.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,混亂之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:39.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於站起的一位知道夢想與惡夢界線的人是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:44.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士 GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.71,0:23:46.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反擊之聲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.96,0:23:50.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向真實的天空展翅翱翔吧 Justice
